      <text:p text:style-name="P17" loext:marker-style-name="T16"><text:span text:style-name="T16">Post the app installation file (APK) on your website for people to find and download. Once people have downloaded the file, they tap on it to install it.</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T16"/></text:p>
